    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Balmoral House offers a unique opportunity to acquire a 4 bedroom detached family home on a secure and conveniently located site, offering a prime village edge location and convenience to a range of local amenities. \r\nIdeally situated in the picturesque historic and medieval village of Castlebellingham only 12.9kms from Dundalk and within easy access to the M1 motorway.\r\nThis inviting family residence offers bright spacious well laid out and tasteful accommodation. On an excellent site approached by electric gates with patio area landscape gardens, detached garage and garden room to the rear.\r\nThe sale of Balmoral House offers a rare opportunity to acquire a delightful home with excellent finishes and an abundance of natural light.\r\nMaking it an ideal choice for growing families or those seeking a spacious home with convenient access to Dundalk, Drogheda, Belfast and Dublin via the M1 motorway."
      },
